From 748cfba756dcfb1581105fc8772b60a92c04236c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 08:33:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 31/32] util: the PS4's FreeBSD 9 kernel, and the PS5's
 conditionals that apply to it

The PS4 runs FreeBSD 9's kernel, whose UMTX_OP_WAIT_UINT takes a relative
struct timespec (struct _umtx_time came with FreeBSD 10). futex_wait()
converts the absolute CLOCK_MONOTONIC timeout for it and, as on Linux,
fails with -1 and errno.

What the PS5 series made conditional on __PROSPERO__ in util and glapi
holds for the PS4's system too: no kinfo_file for os_same_file_description,
the shader cache shared with the FTP service and kept in the title's
folder, __thread over thread_local across libraries, and GL's dispatch
reached through functions.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KvB274h9yAsuA8U9fnRoFR
